sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Test Harness
    participant WD as Workload Driver
    participant SM as State Manager
    participant API as Simulator API
    participant S as Scheduler<br/>(Greedy/BestFit)
    participant E as Decision Enforcer
    participant C1 as Cluster-1<br/>K8s API
    participant C2 as Cluster-2<br/>K8s API
    participant DS2 as Cluster-2<br/>Default Scheduler
    participant M as Metrics Collector
    participant P as Prometheus

    Note over H,P: Initialization Phase
    H->>SM: Bootstrap 3 clusters with KWOK nodes
    H->>WD: Load scenario: arrivals, failures, timing
    SM->>C1: Watch nodes, pods (continuous)
    SM->>C2: Watch nodes, pods (continuous)
    
    Note over H,P: State Aggregation (continuous background)
    loop Every 5s or on change
        C1-->>SM: Node/Pod updates
        C2-->>SM: Node/Pod updates
        SM->>SM: Aggregate into ClusterState v1689
    end

    Note over H,P: Workload Arrival Event
    WD->>SM: Queue workload: mistral-7b, 10 replicas, 1 GPU each
    SM->>SM: Update pendingQueue → v1690
    SM-->>API: State updated (v1690)
    
    Note over H,P: Scheduler Decision Cycle
    S->>API: GET /v1/state<br/>If-None-Match: "1689"
    API->>SM: Fetch latest state
    SM-->>API: ClusterState v1690
    API-->>S: 200 OK (ETag: "1690")<br/>JSON: clusters, nodes, pods, pendingQueue
    
    Note over S: Decision Logic (35ms)<br/>- Calculate fragmentation per cluster<br/>- Cluster-1: score 0.62 (high frag)<br/>- Cluster-2: score 0.77 (better fit)<br/>- Choose Cluster-2
    
    S->>API: POST /v1/placement<br/>If-Match: "1690"<br/>{mode: "ClusterOnly",<br/> cluster: "cluster-2",<br/> modelId: "mistral-7b",<br/> replicas: 10}
    
    Note over API: Validation<br/>- Check version 1690 current<br/>- Validate cluster-2 has capacity<br/>- Check no conflicts
    
    API->>E: Apply decision
    
    Note over H,P: Enforcement: ClusterOnly Mode
    E->>C2: Create Deployment<br/>name: mistral-7b<br/>replicas: 10<br/>resources: 1 GPU per pod<br/>schedulerName: default
    C2-->>E: Deployment created
    E->>SM: Update state → v1691
    
    E-->>API: Applied (v1691)
    API-->>S: 202 Accepted<br/>{appliedVersion: "1691",<br/> executionPlanId: "tp-0042"}
    
    Note over H,P: Default K8s Scheduling (in Cluster-2)
    C2->>DS2: 10 pods pending
    loop For each pod
        DS2->>DS2: Filter nodes (GPU available)<br/>Score nodes (spread, affinity)
        DS2->>C2: Bind pod to node-5
    end
    C2-->>DS2: Pods → Running
    
    Note over H,P: State Propagation
    C2-->>SM: Pod updates (Watch events)
    SM->>SM: Update ClusterState → v1692
    
    Note over H,P: Metrics Collection
    SM->>M: Compute metrics:<br/>- GPU util: +12%<br/>- Fragmentation: -7%<br/>- Decision latency: 35ms<br/>- Time-to-running: 8.3s
    M->>P: Export time series
    
    Note over H,P: Failure Injection (Optional)
    H->>C2: Cordon node-7 (simulate failure)
    C2-->>SM: Node condition changed
    SM->>SM: Update state → v1693
    
    Note over H,P: Scheduler Reacts
    S->>API: GET /v1/state (detects capacity change)
    API-->>S: ClusterState v1693 (node-7 cordoned)
    S->>S: Re-evaluate placements<br/>May trigger rebalancing
    
    Note over H,P: Cycle Repeats
    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over S,E: Next workload arrival →<br/>Scheduler decision →<br/>Enforcement →<br/>Metrics collection
    end
